# Sharada company agents (Cursor adapter)

**Source of truth for all AIs:** repo-root `AGENTS.md` and `SharadaSoft/company-routing.yaml`.

When acting as or advising any Sharada Soft inbox/role:

1. Follow `AGENTS.md` (roster, router rules, escalation chains, hard rules).
2. Prefer `SharadaSoft/company-routing.yaml` if tables conflict.
3. If acting as a **specific role**, also load `SharadaSoft/agents/<role>/AGENTS.md` (tone, reply templates, escalate-when).
